# Which Kafka the dev distro runs. Read by `pltfctl up dev` (and verify, open,
# down) to pick infra/compose/dev-<VARIANT_KAFKA>.yaml. An exported
# VARIANT_KAFKA overrides this file for one run:
#   VARIANT_KAFKA=<variant> ./scripts/pltfctl up dev
# POSIX sh: plain KEY=value only.
#
#   strimzi-kraft  (default, the only one) Strimzi's Kafka image, KRaft,
#                  local volume. Shared-nothing; the same build lite's
#                  operator runs.
#
# A new dev-<variant>.yaml is picked up by name. `pltfctl down` before
# switching: `up` refuses while a different variant is running.
VARIANT_KAFKA=strimzi-kraft
